  <main class="hub">
    <header class="masthead">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">IndyDevDan Expert Book</a>
      <span class="edition">GOLD PILOT · 2026</span>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Operate · retrieve · teach back</p>
        <h1>Build systems that build systems.</h1>
        <p class="hero__dek">A dense, teaching-first companion to IndyDevDan’s course system. Each chapter turns the video spine into mental models, worked codebase examples, failure repairs, retrieval practice, and graded labs.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="progress-card" aria-label="Book progress">
        <p class="eyebrow">Corpus phase 1</p>
        <h2>4 of 18 chapters built</h2>
        <div class="progress-line" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
        <p class="progress-copy"><span>22.2% complete</span><span>TAC chapters 1–4 available</span></p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <article class="chapter-feature">
      <div class="chapter-feature__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 04</p>
        <h2>AFK Agents</h2>
        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Map autonomous work with PITER, trace a real AI Developer Workflow from issue to pull request, and learn the compounding discipline: fix the system, not the artifact.</p>
        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic #4 · Stay Out The Loop</li><li>90–150 min lab</li><li>12 course frames</li><li>2 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
        <a class="button" href="vol-1-tac/04-afk-agents.html">Start chapter →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter-feature__map" aria-label="PITER visual">
        <div class="four"><div>Prompt input</div><div>Trigger</div><div>Environment</div><div>Review</div></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tac-heading">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Volume I</p><h2 id="tac-heading">Tactical Agentic Coding</h2></div><p>4 of 8 chapters · 50%</p></div>
      <div class="lesson-list">
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">01</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/01-hello-agentic-coding.html">Hello Agentic Coding</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stop Coding · Gold chapter</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">02</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/02-the-12-leverage-points.html">The 12 Leverage Points</a></strong><p>Tactic: Adopt Your Agent’s Perspective · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">03</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/03-success-is-planned.html">Success is Planned</a></strong><p>Tactic: Template Your Engineering · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">04</span><div><strong><a href="vol-1-tac/04-afk-agents.html">AFK Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Stay Out The Loop · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">05</span><div><strong>Close the Loops</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">06</span><div><strong>Let Your Agents Focus</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">07</span><div><strong>ZTE Secret of Agentic Engineering</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">08</span><div><strong>The Agentic Layer</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="roadmap-heading">
      <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Course spine</p><h2 id="roadmap-heading">Three-volume roadmap</h2></div><p>18 lessons · synthesis follows</p></div>
      <div class="volumes">
        <article class="volume-card"><p class="eyebrow">Volume I · 8 lessons</p><h3>Tactical Agentic Coding</h3><p>Operational tactics, leverage, planning, AFK agents, loops, focus, zero-touch engineering, and the agentic layer.</p></article>
        <article class="volume-card"><p class="eyebrow">Volume II · 6 lessons</p><h3>Agentic Horizon</h3><p>Context-window mastery, prompt formats, specialized agents, orchestration, agent experts, and agentic layers.</p></article>
        <article class="volume-card"><p class="eyebrow">Volume III · 4 lessons</p><h3>Multi-Agent Systems</h3><p>CEO, lead, UI, and verifier agents, followed by cross-volume synthesis and expert practice.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="hub-footer"><span>Light, offline-first teaching site</span><a href="data/curriculum.json">Curriculum data</a></footer>
  </main>
</body>
