+              <li>□ PITER → PITE and what replaces human review.</li>
+              <li>□ Ten state fields, eight ship fields, three worktree checks.</li>
+              <li>□ Eighteen model-map commands, eight heavy escalations.</li>
+              <li>□ Three review severities and the blocking one.</li>
+              <li>□ Exact Git ship order and <code>--no-ff</code> correction.</li>
+              <li>□ The secret: composable primitives, SDLC as one arrangement.</li>
